WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.300
A boy keeps an all-night vigil for Shiva.

2
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.380
A mouse runs over the sacred
image and eats the offerings.

3
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.630
The boy decides that
God is not in the image.

4
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.260
He grows up to be the
reformer Dayananda Saraswati.

5
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.210
Another reformer, Ram Mohan
Roy, died far from home,

6
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.970
in Bristol, in 1833.

7
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.450
Both men rejected image worship.

8
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.100
Both taught one formless God.

9
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.430
So why did they still disagree?

10
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.170
In this mission, you'll see
India under British rule,

11
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.530
and the challenges Hindus faced.

12
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:37.130
Then you'll compare the two
reformers, point by point.

13
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:42.840
Your mission: find out why two reformers
who both rejected images still disagreed.
